  "description": "Enhance Compatible with 2018-2024 Chevy Traverse with this custom-fit set of TPE floor mats and cargo liner. Specifically designed for 7-seater models with 2nd-row bucket seats, these mats offer seamless alignment using advanced 3D laser scanning technology. Made from eco-friendly, recyclable materials, they are safe for both your family and pets. Whether you’re dealing with rain, snow, or dirt, the high-edge design provides all-weather protection, trapping messes and keeping your interior spotless. With a non-slip bottom and easy installation, these mats stay securely in place. The comprehensive set includes mats for every row and the cargo area, ensuring full coverage and protection for your Chevy Traverse.\nFeatures\nPerfect Custom Fit: Designed specifically fit for the 2018-2025 Chevy Traverse with 2nd-row bucket seats, ensuring precise alignment and full coverage.\nEco-Friendly Material: Made from recyclable, non-toxic TPE material, safe for both humans and pets, while being durable and sustainable.\nAll-Weather Protection: High-edge design effectively traps mud, snow, and water, keeping your vehicle’s interior clean in any weather.\nNon-Slip and Secure: Features a non-slip bottom with a fixing system to keep the mats securely in place, preventing unwanted movement.\nComplete Set for Full Coverage: Includes mats for the first, second, and third rows, plus a cargo mat and backrest mats, ensuring maximum interior protection.\n2 Year Warranty & Highly appreciated professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2018-2024 Chevy Traverse 7-Seater\nwith 2nd Row Bucket Seats\nNot fit to Vinyl Floors",
  "highlights": [
    "All-weather protection system with deep channels and raised edges that trap mud, snow, and spills, keeping your floor clean, dry, and fully protected year-round.",
    "Made from eco-friendly TPE material that is odorless, durable, and flexible, offering long-lasting performance while remaining safe for family use and extreme temperatures.",
    "Waterproof surface allows quick rinse or wipe cleaning, while anti-slip texture and secure fit system keep mats stable and firmly in place during daily driving."
